          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajea ng'eaha siida jea ea bwaraawu jea ghoamu ghwanal ng'asheesu? NG'UTAMIIDA gajea nibalool ng'eaha, siisi jea gwarukwiida ng'asheesuun? Ghwasaan ng'eanyiida sinung' ghoah eemeega nea geanung' ghoah mur ng'eanyi ea gawuurji dareapcheeda, ea mudu gwanda siichea gwasik jeeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aba gideaba niheawa ghoang'waayi huumeanyeekeasu ghayi aayiinyi madeeda nyaawa, ak hean ghaheawa gooleeysiit ng'asheegeasu ak ghwaat naweadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aba hang'ooynacheeka nyaawa ea niyaat geeshta gidanyah gurooruunatka nyaawa, ak hean ghwaat geeshta Baali gawuurji gida ghayi analda ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli. Ng'ula fiisu gaydang'ata aba sawanadeeda nea ghaanung' ghwali beega mideawa furooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadearsa jeeda eemoojiga ghayi miighwanal saawa ea ghweaniga nyaawa; ak gaydanung' gawa ng'uta badahuuka nyaawa, bwak ea dahuuyda goosha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Yerusalemu gagasa weeta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
